Upgrading
*********


Upgrading to Version 2.3
========================

- it is recommended to change the `safe://...` protocol to the namespaced `nette.safe://...`

{{maintitle: Upgrading Nette SafeStream: What Changed in Version 2.3}}
{{description: What changed in Nette SafeStream 2.3: the recommended protocol changed from safe:// to the namespaced nette.safe://.}}
